%% Anything not drawn here is forbidden.
%% Every transition carries its command and its slice.
%% A business day is per Property and per business date (ADR 0021): the day a
%% Property is working, which rolls at its cutoff, not at midnight.
%% draft and superseded are derived, never stored (ADR 0034): draft is "the
%% cutoff has passed and there is no close"; superseded is "a later revision
%% exists". A close row is append-only, so a stored state could never leave.
%% Only finalized is stored today. reopened, corrected and superseded are
%% blueprint 18.2's and are drawn so the deferral is visible, not built.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR

  state "open (the working day)" as d_open
  state "draft (cutoff passed, not closed)" as d_draft
  state "finalized" as d_finalized
  state "reopened" as d_reopened
  state "corrected" as d_corrected
  state "superseded" as d_superseded

  [*] --> d_open : the business date begins
  d_open --> d_draft : the cutoff passes / derived, no command
  d_draft --> d_finalized : closeDay / s1 / built
  d_draft --> d_finalized : closeDueDays (worker) / s2 / built, only when nothing is open
  d_finalized --> d_reopened : reopenDay / not built, CD-DEF-02
  d_reopened --> d_corrected : closeDay / not built, CD-DEF-03
  d_finalized --> d_superseded : a later revision is written / not built
  d_corrected --> d_superseded : a later revision is written / not built

  note right of d_draft
    Days close in order: a draft day waits for the day before it.
    The first close at a Property is its business date before today.
    Refused while the cutoff has not passed: the clock decides that,
    never a close, so app.property_today() is never moved by one.
  end note

  note right of d_finalized
    One row per Property and business date, append-only.
    It freezes: arrivals, departures, nights occupied,
    departed Guests whose Folio is still open,
    and the items left open, which need a reason.
    Named: the Staff Member, or the job.
    Nothing written after it may be dated on it:
    a check-in on it cannot be withdrawn,
    and a cutoff or time zone cannot move today back onto it.
  end note
